          "reference": "mcp:connection:(api,platform-admin)"
        },
        {
          "text": "util (api)\nBuilt-in utility connection. Operations are handled inside the platform rather than proxied to an upstream API. `fetch_url` (`POST /util/fetch`) retrieves an arbitrary public URL server-side - a presigned download link, a generated report URL - inline via api_invoke_endpoint or streamed to a portal asset via api_export. Destinations on internal address space are refused.",
